    {
      "name": "Fire Bolt",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>You hurl a mote of fire at a creature or an object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell starts burning if it isn't being worn or carried.</p><p><strong>Cantrip Upgrade.</strong> The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
